Let's expand the powers for $\greenD{3^{10}}=\blueD{3^7}\cdot\purpleD{x^3}$.

$\begin{align}
&=\blueD{\underbrace{3\cdot3\cdot3\cdot3\cdot3\cdot3\cdot3}_\text{7 times}}\cdot\purpleD{\underbrace{x\cdot x\cdot x   }_\text{3 times}}
\\\\\\
&=\greenD{\underbrace{3\cdot 3\cdot 3\cdot 3\cdot  3\cdot  3\cdot 3\cdot 3\cdot 3\cdot 3}_\text{10 times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
